# Working directories that belong to tooling rather than to this codebase, and to whoever is
# running it rather than to this repo's formatting rules. Prettier scans the whole tree, so an
# unformatted scratch directory here fails `prettier:check` — which is in `npm run complete`, which
# the pre-commit hook runs. One person's working notes would otherwise block every commit in every
# concurrent session, and the way out people find is `--no-verify`, which costs the whole gate.
.claude/
